---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Rotary couples
description: Couples in Rotary District 3110 where both are Rotarians, who chose to share their anniversary.
permalink: /couples/
noindex: true
---
{% from "macros.njk" import avatar %}
<div class="wrap section">
  <h1>Rotary couples</h1>
  <p class="lead">Husbands and wives who are both Rotarians, serving side by side. Each couple chose to share their anniversary.</p>
  {%- if site.rotarianCouples.length %}
  <ul class="couple-wall">
    {%- for c in site.rotarianCouples %}
    <li class="couple-tile">
      {%- if c.couplePhoto %}<img class="couple-photo" src="{{ c.couplePhoto }}" alt="Photo of {{ c.a.name }} and {{ c.b.name }}" width="480" height="320" loading="lazy">
      {%- else %}<span class="cel-photos">{{ avatar(c.a.name, c.a.photo, 88) }}{{ avatar(c.b.name, c.b.photo, 88) }}</span>{% endif %}
      <h3>{% if c.a.u %}<a href="{{ c.a.u }}">{{ c.a.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ c.a.name }}{% endif %} &amp; {% if c.b.u %}<a href="{{ c.b.u }}">{{ c.b.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ c.b.name }}{% endif %}</h3>
      {%- if c.bridging %}
      <p class="small"><a href="{{ c.a.clubUrl }}">{{ c.a.club }}</a> and <a href="{{ c.b.clubUrl }}">{{ c.b.club }}</a></p>
      <p><span class="chip">Bridging two clubs</span></p>
      {%- else %}
      <p class="small"><a href="{{ c.a.clubUrl }}">{{ c.a.club }}</a></p>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- if c.md %}<p class="small muted">Anniversary {{ c.md | dayMonth }}</p>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
  {%- else %}
  <p>No couples yet.</p>
  {%- endif %}
  <p class="small">Both Rotarians? Each of you gives the anniversary and your spouse's Rotary ID on the <a href="/update/">Update my details form</a>, and chooses List for the anniversary on the <a href="/consent/">Show my details form</a>. You appear here once both have done so.</p>
</div>
